WEBVTT

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.751
Baby, carry on

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:13.756
When the winds of tomorrow howl

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:19.762
Keep on laughing, be the cocky
person that you are

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.949
No matter what happens

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:34.366
Storming through life, during
the day you feel invincible

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:42.006
Of course, there are those nights
when everything falls apart

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:48.938
You find yourself humming
an old melody

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:56.132
Through the pain you feel as sweat
stings your wounded knee

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.167
Baby, carry on

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:02.594
Even on those mornings when
the wind blows in your face

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:09.311
Keep on laughing, and even the moon
shall one day look upon you

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.313
Someday your journey will come

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:16.519
| can at least make one
miracle happen

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.255
