And then...

00:16:49.375 --> 00:16:52.140
Junpei, I love you.

00:16:57.883 --> 00:17:00.147
Come on, Ms. Airi! Hurry!

00:17:02.187 --> 00:17:03.965
| said no! Can't you hear?!

00:17:03.989 --> 00:17:06.468
Listen to what others have
to say for once!

00:17:06.492 --> 00:17:08.970
Absolutely, the potions should
be saved as a last resort!

00:17:08.994 --> 00:17:11.190
I'm going back inside the tank.

00:17:13.499 --> 00:17:15.058
Ritsuko!

00:17:19.438 --> 00:17:22.499
All of the sudden...

00:17:25.577 --> 00:17:27.389
| need to sleep.

00:17:27.413 --> 00:17:29.438
| suddenly feel so darn tired.

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:39.868
While it may not work against
the skeletons,

00:17:39.892 --> 00:17:42.504
my magic still works its charm on you.

00:17:42.528 --> 00:17:49.195
You! I will definitely strip you.

00:17:52.404 --> 00:17:56.851
You've cast a sleeping spell,
at a time like this?

00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:59.421
Do you have any idea
what you've done?

00:17:59.445 --> 00:18:02.490
Well, what admirable concentration.

00:18:02.514 --> 00:18:05.360
But I will be the one to
have the last laugh!

00:18:05.384 --> 00:18:06.828
Don't worry.

00:18:06.852 --> 00:18:12.450
I intend to protect this city by
using your Sacred Water.

00:18:14.126 --> 00:18:17.357
Red or blue, which vial is it?!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.528
What's the use?

00:18:21.066 --> 00:18:24.012
You wouldn't believe me even
if I told you, would you?

00:18:24.036 --> 00:18:26.027
All I have is my instincts.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.184
It's the red one!

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.351
You laughed.

00:18:47.426 --> 00:18:50.872
You underestimate the extraordinary
sensory capacity of elves.

00:18:50.896 --> 00:18:53.456
| just heard you smirk at me.

00:18:57.503 --> 00:18:58.980
Forgive my trickery,

00:18:59.004 --> 00:19:01.282
but I just made you think that |
had drunk from the red vial.

00:19:01.306 --> 00:19:03.985
So the blue one is the holy water.

00:19:04.009 --> 00:19:08.089
No, please wait! That is something
that's really important to us!

00:19:08.113 --> 00:19:12.026
Silence! I will be the one
to safeguard this city

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:14.109
and destroy the evil monsters.

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:22.920
This is the sacred potion?

00:19:26.265 --> 00:19:30.345
You see, I was fully aware of the
extreme sensitivities of elves.

00:19:30.369 --> 00:19:31.346
What?!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:31.846
Your performance was pretty good,
What?!

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:32.981
Your performance was pretty good,

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:35.049
but what do you think of my acting

00:19:35.073 --> 00:19:38.253
in the part of a deceived
and distraught human?

00:19:38.277 --> 00:19:39.621
That can't be!

00:19:39.645 --> 00:19:42.423
Do you mean to tell me that slight
smirk on your face was acting?!

00:19:42.447 --> 00:19:44.225
The correct choice was red.

00:19:44.249 --> 00:19:48.015
What you just drank was the
enlargement potion.

00:19:57.996 --> 00:19:59.274
What the hell is that?

00:19:59.298 --> 00:19:59.474
It's Mistress Dihal!
What the hell is that?

00:19:59.498 --> 00:20:00.642
It's Mistress Dihal!

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:00.775
It's Mistress Dihal! It's a giant Mistress
Dihal, the leader of our security force!

00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:03.244
It's a giant Mistress Dihal, the
leader of our security force!

00:20:03.268 --> 00:20:05.236
Fred, stop looking at her!

00:20:06.505 --> 00:20:09.017
Big boobs! Big boobs!

00:20:09.041 --> 00:20:11.339
Now stop it, this is not
meant for your eyes!

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.277
| say, this is my lucky day.
Yeah, check it out!

00:20:17.316 --> 00:20:19.512
| can't believe this!

00:20:21.053 --> 00:20:24.666
Yes, Mistress Dihal sure is something!

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:27.057
Airi, where have you hidden yourself?!

00:20:27.859 --> 00:20:29.304
I'll stomp on you!

00:20:29.328 --> 00:20:34.198
Damn you, Airi!

00:20:36.201 --> 00:20:40.415
Well, I guess she didn't have a
fragment tattooed on her after all.

00:20:40.439 --> 00:20:43.151
Wow, you just amaze me, Ms. Airi.

00:20:43.175 --> 00:20:45.587
How you were able to trick
that elf so easily?

00:20:45.611 --> 00:20:49.624
Thank you. I thought turning
her into a giant

00:20:49.648 --> 00:20:52.481
would be an easy way
to get her nude.

00:20:53.085 --> 00:20:56.064
Then you purposely told her about
the existence of the potions?

00:20:56.088 --> 00:20:57.031
Yes, I did.

00:20:57.055 --> 00:20:57.565
You aren't an Oscar-winning
actress for nothing. Yes, I did.

00:20:57.589 --> 00:20:58.866
You aren't an Oscar-winning
actress for nothing.

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:01.035
Actually, she performed more
like a used car salesman.

00:21:01.059 --> 00:21:02.737
Oh, you're too kind.

00:21:02.761 --> 00:21:04.305
So, what would have happened

00:21:04.329 --> 00:21:06.574
if she had used the red
potion instead?

00:21:06.598 --> 00:21:08.543
That potion is not meant
to be swallowed.

00:21:08.567 --> 00:21:12.046
Powerful magical energy was
sealed inside that liquid.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:16.084
You need to apply a strong physical
shock to ignite its properties.

00:21:16.108 --> 00:21:18.186
So, it's like nitroglycerin?

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.178
A strong physical shock?

00:21:21.113 --> 00:21:24.626
Airi, where are you!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.414
'I crush you!

00:21:31.823 --> 00:21:36.021
All right! So, where's the next elf?!

00:21:53.378 --> 00:22:00.461
It's okay to take a break on a day
when you feel despondent

00:22:00.485 --> 00:22:07.435
Life is long and fickle, you know

00:22:07.459 --> 00:22:14.575
| can make you a hundred
times stronger

00:22:14.599 --> 00:22:17.812
Come on, let's sleep for now

00:22:17.836 --> 00:22:21.716
Hold me gently

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:26.701
Even if you met a dinosaur

00:22:28.847 --> 00:22:35.530
You are the kind of person that
would just laugh it off

00:22:35.554 --> 00:22:42.236
Winning through flower gardens
and storm ravaged plains

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:49.877
| can hear how the times are
changing around us

00:22:49.901 --> 00:22:56.551
Distinguishing both the
sour and the sweet

00:22:56.575 --> 00:23:04.575
Just don't give up, because the genius
always comes at the end

00:23:09.821 --> 00:23:12.633
Hello, this is Airi Komiyama.

00:23:12.657 --> 00:23:15.627
| am currently away on a film shoot.

00:23:16.161 --> 00:23:18.573
Those needing to speak to me,

00:23:18.597 --> 00:23:21.828
please leave a message after the beep.

00:23:25.003 --> 00:23:27.115
The next episode is about martial arts

00:23:27.139 --> 00:23:29.450
and features plenty of flying-fist action.

00:23:29.474 --> 00:23:32.286
Next Those Who Hunt Elves:

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.989
"The Search for the 1000th Fighter"

00:23:35.013 --> 00:23:37.448
Please be awake for next
week's episode.
